@startuml
title ioScope Runtime Component View
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

component "controller.py" as bootstrap
component "ioQtScopeWindow" as qtWindow
component "ioScopeShell" as shell
component "ioOscilloscopeController" as controller
component "ioOscilloscopeModel" as model
component "ioCompactOscilloscopeView" as compactView
component "ioDetailedOscilloscopeView" as detailedView
component "ioWaveformGenerator" as generator
component "ioFilterPipeline" as filterPipeline
component "ioFtdiWaveformSource" as ftdiSource
component "ioFileWaveformSource" as fileSource
component "ioGeneratedWaveformSource" as generatedSource
component "ioDataBuffer" as buffer
component "ioUsbReadController" as readWorker
component "ioUsbWriteController" as writeWorker

bootstrap --> qtWindow : scope-qt
bootstrap --> shell : scope-shell
qtWindow --> controller : UI events
shell --> controller : CLI commands
controller --> model
controller --> compactView : render()
controller --> detailedView : render()
model --> generator : acquire raw signal
model --> filterPipeline : scale + offset
generator --> ftdiSource
generator --> fileSource
generator --> generatedSource
readWorker --> buffer
writeWorker --> buffer

note bottom of controller
The controller fans out one processed
render state to both concrete views.
end note

note bottom of qtWindow
The Qt window is a host component.
It chooses which concrete view is visible
without replacing the single View abstraction.
end note

note bottom of buffer
The implemented transport path uses one shared
bounded circular buffer between the two workers.
end note
@enduml
